Otavue Extensions

themes/gigaviewer.js and sites/gigaviewer.json are ported from Keiyoushi's
extensions (https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source: lib-multisrc/gigaviewer
and the src/ja/* sources built on it), licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
which in turn continue the Tachiyomi and Mihon projects' extensions.

themes/mangadex.js is written from MangaDex's public API documentation
(https://api.mangadex.org/docs/).
